==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|frightfull}} {{qualifier|archaic}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|frightful||afraid}}, from {{inh|en|ang|forhtfull||fainthearted, timorous}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|en|fright|ful|pos=adjective}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|frīt′fəl}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈfɹaɪtfəl/}}
* {{hyph|en|fright|ful}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-frightful.ogg|a=US}}

